    "25920171": {
      "m_bError": null,
      "m_KeyName": "25920171",
      "m_KeyValue": "\"\"The dagger that gleamed under the silver moon was proof of direct descent from the Ganelon family. It would grow stronger as Clive Jr. grew, and vanish when his life came to an end. It was also his only solace—that he shared a deeper bond with his foster father than his sister ever did.\nHe dreamed of the day his dagger would become a great sword. But when that day finally came, he understood the look in Clive's eyes—a gaze filled with pity, mourning the youth forever trapped in this endless cycle...\"\""
    },
